 "title": "Auditor / Fountain County, Indiana",
 "text": "Auditor / Fountain County, Indiana\nBreaking News\nAPC Meeting October 22nd 8:00 pm: Solar Ordinance public hearing\nSkip over navigation\nFountain County, Indiana\nMenu\nHome\nGovernment  Elected Officials  Commissioners  Meeting Center\nCounty Council  Meeting Center\nAssessor\nAuditor\nClerk\nCoroner\nFountain Circuit Court\nProsecutor\nRecorder\nTreasurer\nDepartments  Ambulance\nCommunity Corrections\nHealth\nHighway\nPlanning & Zoning  Plan Commission\nProbation\nPurdue Extension\nVeterans Affairs\nPublic Safety  911 Communications (Fountain/Warren Counties)\nEmergency Management  ADA Plan\nSheriff\nElection  Absentee Voting\nCandidate Information\nElection Information\nPoll Workers\nVoter Registration\nVoting Locations\nCommunity  Browse the County Staff\nFind an Event\nFind a Location\nRegister for the County Emergency Notification System\nTour the County Courthouse Murals\nView FAQs\nVisit the Meeting Center\nFind a Document  Forms & Applications\nMinutes\nNews & Notices\nOrdinances & Resolutions\nPlans & Maps\nSearch\nSubmit\nStart Content\nContact Us\nKim Johnson ,\nAuditor\nCounty Courthouse\n301 4th St\nCovington, IN 47932 Get Directions\nPhone: (765) 793-6243\nEmail Us\nStaff Directory\nHours: Monday - Friday\n8:00 am - 4:00 pm\nIn this Department\nHR/Payroll\nJump to a division Make a Selection HR/Payroll Section Home\nTopics of Interest\nAuditor's Fee Schedule\nDeductions/Exemptions\nGateway\nHomestead & Mortgage Deductions FAQ\nNotice to Taxpayers\nOver 65 Deduction FAQ\nProperty Tax Benefits\nPublic Document Portal\nPublic Notices\nTax Sale / Certificate Sale\nJump to a topic or subtopic Make a Selection Auditor's Fee Schedule Deductions/Exemptions Gateway Homestead & Mortgage Deductions FAQ Notice to Taxpayers Over 65 Deduction FAQ Property Tax Benefits Public Document Portal Public Notices Tax Sale / Certificate Sale Topic Home\nMore Information\nFind content and services related to this page.\nDocument Center News & Notices\nOrdinances & Resolutions\nJump to a content archive Make a Selection Document Center\n- News & Notices\n- Ordinances & Resolutions\nHome\nGovernment\nAuditor\nAuditor\nThe Auditor’s Office is at the center of the county. The office looks to check and balance the County to ensure the accounts are accurate. Our department works very closely with the Treasurer and Assessor to allow us to reconcile against each other. The Auditor’s office not only has to answer to the State agencies, but we serve the tax payer first.\nA few of the duties that are done in the office are deductions on your property, transfers, maintenance, abatements, budgets, payroll, accounts payable, tax sales, Tif, certification of net assessed values, distribution of tax revenue, accounting of all federal grants, settlement and general tax calculations.\nThe Auditor also serves as secretary for the County Commissioners and County Council . The office is the official keeper of the minutes, ordinances, resolutions, contracts and bonds.\nWe strive to create the best possible environment for the tax payers to get the information they need.\nNEWS\nNews\nNotice to Tax Payers (Budget 2025 Form 3 FCSWMD)\nNotice to Taxpayers (Budget 2025 Form 3)\nNotice to Taxpayers (2025 Budget - FCSWMD)\nNotice to Taxpayers (2025 Budget)\nNotice to Taxpayers\nMore News\nFOUNTAIN COUNTY, IN\n301 4th St., Covington, IN 47932 • M-F 8:00am - 4:00pm • 765-793-5000 • Staff Directory\n© 2026 Fountain County, Indiana\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility Statement\nTerms of Use\n-->\nSite Design and Content Management by\nCORE Business Technologies",
